  "method_notes": [
    "Used only the supplied study contents and respondents.csv; calculations used local Python libraries. No browsing, connectors, file discovery, external material or delegated agents.",
    "Evidence references are exact JSON Pointer paths to analysis tables embedded in analysis_claims; each table also has a stable analysis_id. Base references resolve to the corresponding assigned, module-eligible and intent-valid tables.",
    "All households and responses are synthetic. Results concern the specified hypothetical frame, not all UK households or actual customers. Scenario target shares are assumptions rather than external population statistics.",
    "Fixed positive wt_design was used unchanged throughout. Weighted N means sum of weights; Kish ESS=(sum w)^2/sum(w^2). Every published outcome denominator exceeds the small-base thresholds except explicitly suppressed cells.",
    "Intent-valid means codes 1\u20135; positive means 4 or 5. Codes 97, 98 and 99 and structural blanks were kept separate. Missing responses were scored zero only in q0 and its financial sensitivities, never relabelled as a substantive intent category.",
    "Working variance was n/(n\u22121)*sum(w_i^2*(y_i\u2212mu)^2)/(sum w_i)^2. Independent-arm contrast variances were added, with squared price or price-minus-cost coefficients for proxies. All intervals are unadjusted pointwise normal 95% intervals, not simultaneous intervals.",
    "Two-sided tests used erfc(abs(estimate/SE)/sqrt(2)). Holm adjustment used the fixed P1, P2 and P3 six-test families, the joint P4 eighteen-test family, and the P5 two-test family. Very small p values are reported as inequalities rather than zero. All-assigned financial sensitivities have intervals but no additional confirmatory tests.",
    "No routed usage, certainty or reasons estimates were needed for this prioritisation. Hypothetical usage would not validate conversion. No transactions, paid uptake, repeat use, retention or actual costs were observed.",
    "Financial proxies mechanically equate positive stated intent with one subscriber-month. They are not demand, revenue forecasts or profit. All three predeclared cost scenarios are retained; no elasticity curve, interpolated optimum or ROI is inferred.",
    "Displayed estimates are rounded; calculations and adjustment used unrounded values. Recommendations identify candidates for future behavioural validation, not a validated or proven optimal price."
  ]
